{"displayStem":"같은 고정 협착의 관류실험이다. 점들을 곧은 선으로만 연결한 그림이며 혈액 성상·기하학·유입조건은 고정했다. 실제 환자 FFR 기준은 아니다.","notes":[{"kind":"provenance","text":"교육 목적으로 구성한 학습자료입니다."}],"evidenceMarkup":["<div class=\"dataset-evidence batch-C02 c02-batch\"><div class=\"evidence c02-vector\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 520 350\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"교육용 자료 68\" style=\"font-family:Arial,'Noto Sans CJK KR',sans-serif\"><rect width=\"520\" height=\"350\" fill=\"white\"></rect><text x=\"78\" y=\"24\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"start\">압력손실 (mmHg)</text><path d=\"M78,60 L78,270\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"></path><path d=\"M78,270 L483,270\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"></path><path d=\"M78.0,270 L78.0,276\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"></path><text x=\"78.0\" y=\"298\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text><path d=\"M179.25,270 L179.25,276\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"></path><text x=\"179.25\" y=\"298\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text><path d=\"M280.5,270 L280.5,276\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"></path><text x=\"280.5\" y=\"298\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text><path d=\"M381.75,270 L381.75,276\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"></path><text x=\"381.75\" y=\"298\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3</text><path d=\"M483.0,270 L483.0,276\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"></path><text x=\"483.0\" y=\"298\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\">4</text><path d=\"M72,270.0 L78,270.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"></path><text x=\"66\" y=\"275.0\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"end\">0</text><path d=\"M72,201.66666666666669 L78,201.66666666666669\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"></path><text x=\"66\" y=\"206.66666666666669\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"end\">4</text><path d=\"M72,133.33333333333334 L78,133.3333333